  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: value conversion is split out of FileColumnMappingField. New FileValueConversionField (one per target field: TargetField / ConversionModule / ExternalField / InternalField; for a LinkField target, ConversionModule defaults to the link target module and InternalField to Id) converts the value of a field between the file representation and the DB value, in the standard (internal-name header) format as well as together with FileColumnMappingField. MappingColumn.ConversionModule / ConversionExternalField / ConversionInternalField are obsolete and no longer applied; the design check reports columns that still have them, and the designer migration 'File column mapping: move code conversion to File Value Conversion fields' (IDesignDataMigration, offered when the project was last saved with an older Extras) moves them to FileValueConversionFields. Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.34 and Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server 0.13.0.",
